<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>Research Proposal</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Improving the Quality of Life for People with Disabilities</p>
    </header>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Executive Summary</h2>
        <p>This proposal outlines a strategic research initiative aimed at addressing disparities in accessibility and inclusion within the global community. By leveraging advanced technology and community engagement, we aim to empower individuals with disabilities to access opportunities that previously were denied.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Key Objectives</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Enhance Accessibility:</strong> Develop scalable solutions for barrier-free environments across diverse regions.</li>
            <li><strong>Inclusive Education:</strong> Create curriculum materials tailored to neurodiverse learners.</li>
            <li><strong>Community Integration:</strong> Foster networks that support marginalized groups through digital platforms.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Methodology</h2>
        <p>We will utilize a mixed-methods approach combining quantitative data analysis (surveys, usability testing) with qualitative interviews with disability advocates and researchers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Implementation Timeline</h2>
        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
            <tr style="background-color: #f9f9f9;">
                <th style="padding: 10px;">Phase</th>
                <th style="padding: 10px;">Duration</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Phase 1: Planning & Design</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Months 1-3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Phase 2: Pilot Testing</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Months 4-6</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Phase 3: Scaling & Evaluation</td>
                <td style="padding: 10px;">Months 7-9</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Expected Outcomes</h2>
        <p>The ultimate goal is to reduce the cost of living barriers for disabled individuals while fostering greater social cohesion.</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <strong>Future Outlook:</strong> This project aims to contribute significantly to the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals, specifically Goal 5 on Clean Water and Sanitation and Goal 16 on Decent Work and Economic Growth.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For further details or to discuss this proposal, please contact the Research Team at <a href="mailto:contact@disability-research.org">contact@disability-research.org</a>.</p>
    </div>
</div>

